feature function get_relative_ata
  > Get the execution position of the function relatively to the position of the executing entity.
  authors: "Aksiome", "Leirof"
  contributors: "RacoonJohn"
  created: 2019/07/14 1.14.3
  updated: 2026/10/14 26.3

  context position > Position to get the relative position from.
  context executor > Entity positioned at the reference point.
  input storage: $scale

feature function get_relative_from_dir
  > Get a direction vector based on the execution position and rotation. Scale is used as the norm/length.
  authors: "Aksiome", "Leirof"
  contributors: "RacoonJohn"
  created: 2023/10/20 1.20.2
  updated: 2026/10/14 26.3

  context position > Position to get the relative position from.
  context rotation > Rotation to get the relative position from.
  context executor > Entity to store the score to.
  input storage: $scale

feature function local_to_canonical
  > Convert a local position (using the local reference frame) into a canonical position (using the relative reference frame).
  authors: "Aksiome"
  contributors: "RacoonJohn"
  created: 2023/12/25 1.20.4
  updated: 2026/10/14 26.3

  context rotation > Rotation used for the conversion

